14. ENTRY, EXIT AND PRICE-ZONE ENGINE
Calculate entry zones from actual market structure, support/demand, breakout retests, volume confirmation, supply absorption and risk/reward.
Calculate exit zones:
Target 1: nearest reasonable objective.
Target 2: next significant resistance or liquidity objective.
Target 3: extended objective, only where justified.
Explain the evidence for each target.
Specify logical stop-loss, structural invalidation and percentage risk.
Minimum preferred risk/reward: 2:1. Preferred: 3:1 or higher.
Reject or downgrade unsuitable setups.
